 OnlyNegative (For inputs)
 RegexValidation (Validates inputs using pattern rule) - Complex
 TrimWhitespace (Will remove spaces in entered inputs)
 CommandInput (Callsback depending on commannds, has autofill - For inputs)
 Debounce (Lets a card be activated # amounts in a given time period)
 AutoDisable (Disables with given condition) - Complex
 RequireDoubleClick (Self Explaniatory)
 RequireState (Requires a state to activate (e.g. swimming)) - Complex
